From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nicola Ferralis <ferralis@generalflash.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:26:36 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] ext: TAIGA_KEEP_HELDOUT=1 trains on the held-out compositions

Upstream holds two compositions out of training (any pattern with boss_box, hole_std followed
by a mirror) so the comp suites can measure generalization. A production model should train on
them: the S 80 casing's feet are boss_box blocks repeated by a linear pattern. With
TAIGA_KEEP_HELDOUT=1 training goals (upstream, expanded and goals-file goals) may contain them,
and mixed training goals also use boss_box (on top, on side faces, as cross blocks through the
part repeated up the height, patterned and mirrored) and mirror hole_std. Evaluation suites
are unchanged, so for such a run comp measures pairs it has seen.
